  8001: {"desc": {"en": "Max Lv : 5\nDescription: ^777777Restore the Master's HP with a\nmethod that mimics the Acolyte's Heal skill.\nThe amount of restored HP is affected by the\nskill's level, Humonculi's Base Level and INT.\n^00BB00Each cast requires 1 Condensed Red Potion.^000000\nSP Consumption By Level\n[Lv 1]:^77777713 SP^000000\n[Lv 2]:^77777716 SP^000000\n[Lv 3]:^77777719 SP^000000\n[Lv 4]:^77777722 SP^000000\n[Lv 5]:^77777725 SP^000000", "pt": "Nível máximo: ^7777775^000000\nTipo: ^777777Suporte^000000\nDescrição:\n^777777Recupera o HP do mestre.\nA quantia curada de HP depende do nível da\nhabilidade, da INT e do nível base do mestre.\n^000088Consome 1 Poção Vermelha Compacta.^000000\nNível l Custo de SP\n[Nv 1]: ^77777713^000000\n[Nv 2]: ^77777716^000000\n[Nv 3]: ^77777719^000000\n[Nv 4]: ^77777722^000000\n[Nv 5]: ^77777725^000000"}, "name": {"en": "Healing Hands", "pt": "Cura pelas Mãos"}},
  8002: {"desc": {"en": "Max Lv : 5\nDescription: ^777777Temporarily increase the moving\nspeed of caster and Homunculus so that they can\nescape from a critical situation.^000000\n[Lv 1]:^77777740 Sec Duration Movement Speed +10%^000000\n[Lv 2]:^77777735 Sec Duration Movement Speed +20%^000000\n[Lv 3]:^77777730 Sec Duration Movement Speed +30%^000000\n[Lv 4]:^77777725 Sec Duration Moving Speed +40%^000000\n[Lv 5]:^77777720 Sec Duration Movement Speed +50%000000", "pt": "Nível máximo: ^7777775^000000\nPré-requisitos: ^777777Cura pelas Mãos 3^000000\nTipo: ^777777Suporte^000000\nDescrição:\n^777777Acelera o movimento da Lif e do mestre.\nNão acumula com Aumentar Agilidade.^000000\nNível l Movimento l Duração\n[Nv 1]: ^777777+10%^000000 l ^77777740 segundos^000000\n[Nv 2]: ^777777+20%^000000 l ^77777735 segundos^000000\n[Nv 3]: ^777777+30%^000000 l ^77777730 segundos^000000\n[Nv 4]: ^777777+40%^000000 l ^77777725 segundos^000000\n[Nv 5]: ^777777+50%^000000 l ^77777720 segundos^000000"}, "name": {"en": "Urgent Escape", "pt": "Bater em Retirada"}},
  8004: {"desc": {"en": "Max Lv : 3\nDescription: ^777777Exchange the Lif Homunculus's MaxSP\nwith its MaxHP for this skill's duration.\nUpon activating this skill, Lif's HP will be\nfully restored and will perform normal attacks\nthat inflict damage equal to its Magic Attack\nPower. This skill is cancelled after its\nduration and Lif's remaining HP and SP will\nbecome 10.^000000\n[Lv 1] ^7777771 Min Duration 10 Min Cast Delay^000000\n[Lv 2] ^7777773 Min Duration 15 Min Cast Delay^000000\n[Lv 3] ^7777775 Min Duration 20 Min Cast Delay^000000", "pt": "Nível máximo: ^7777773^000000\nPré-requisitos: ^CD3278Lealdade alta na 2ª forma^000000\nTipo: ^777777Suporte^000000\nDescrição:\n^777777Aumenta a VIT e INT da Lif.\nAtaques da Lif serão baseados no ATQM.\nQuando a duração do efeito terminar, o HP\ne o SP da Lif serão drenados para 10.^000000\nNível l VIT l INT l Duração\n[Nv 1]: ^777777+30^000000 l ^777777+20^000000 l ^7777771 min.^000000\n[Nv 2]: ^777777+60^000000 l ^777777+40^000000 l ^7777773 min.^000000\n[Nv 3]: ^777777+90^000000 l ^777777+60^000000 l ^7777775 min.^000000"}, "name": {"en": "Mental Charge", "pt": "Esforço Mental"}},
  8005: {"desc": {"en": "Max Lv :5\nDescription: ^777777Instantly switch the location of\nthe caster with the Amistr Homunculus so that\nmonsters attacking the caster will target\nAmistr instead.^000000\n[Lv 1]:^77777720% Success Chance^000000\n[Lv 2]:^77777740% Success Chance^000000\n[Lv 3]:^77777760% Success Chance^000000\n[Lv 4]:^77777780% Success Chance^000000\n[Lv 5]:^777777100% Success Chance^000000", "pt": "Nível máximo: ^7777775^000000\nTipo: ^777777Ativa^000000\nDescrição:\n^777777Faz o Amistr trocar de lugar com o mestre.\nExistem chances de falha e nada acontecer.\nNão funciona na Guerra do Emperium.^000000\nNível l Chance de sucesso\n[Nv 1]: ^77777720%^000000\n[Nv 2]: ^77777740%^000000\n[Nv 3]: ^77777760%^000000\n[Nv 4]: ^77777780%^000000\n[Nv 5]: ^777777100%^000000"}, "name": {"en": "Castling", "pt": "Troca de Lugar"}},
