  8008: {"desc": {"en": "Max Lv : 3\nDescription: ^777777Increase the Homunculus's Attack\nPower for the duration of this skill. During\nthe Blood Lust status, each attack has the\nchance of restoring an amount of HP to\nHomunculus equal to 20% of the damage inflicted\nto targeted enemy.^000000\n[Lv 1]:^7777771 Min Duration Attack Power +130%\n HP Gain Chance +3% 5 Min Cast Delay^000000\n[Lv 2]:^7777773 Min Duration Attack Power +140%\n HP Gain Chance +6% 10 Min Cast Delay^000000\n[Lv 3]:^7777775 Min Duration Attack Power +150%\n HP Gain Chance +9% 15 Min Cast Delay^000000", "pt": "Nível máximo: ^7777773^000000\nPré-requisitos: ^CD3278Lealdade alta na 2ª forma^000000\nTipo: ^777777Suporte^000000\nDescrição:\n^777777Melhora o ATQ do Homunculus e concede\na chance de converter 20% do dano físico\ncausado em HP para o Amistr.^000000\nNível l ATQ l Duração l Chance de Conversão\n[Nv 1]: ^777777+30%^000000 l ^7777771 min.^000000 l ^7777773%^000000\n[Nv 2]: ^777777+40%^000000 l ^7777773 min.^000000 l ^7777776%^000000\n[Nv 3]: ^777777+50%^000000 l ^7777775 min.^000000 l ^7777779%^000000"}, "name": {"en": "Blood Lust", "pt": "Desejo de Sangue"}},
  8009: {"desc": {"en": "Max Lv :5\nDescription: ^777777Command Filir Homunculus to peck\nrepeatedly at a nearby target.^000000\n[Lv 1]:^7777771 Peck, Damage +220%^000000\n[Lv 2]:^7777772 Pecks, Damage +330%^000000\n[Lv 3]:^7777772 Pecks, Damage +440%^000000\n[Lv 4]:^7777772 Pecks, Damage +550%^000000\n[Lv 5]:^7777773 Pecks, Damage +660%^000000", "pt": "Nível máximo: ^7777775^000000\nTipo: ^777777Ofensiva^000000\nDescrição:\n^777777Faz o Filir causar dano físico no alvo único.^000000\nNível l ATQ l Bicadas\n[Nv 1]: ^777777220%^000000 l ^7777771 ataque^000000\n[Nv 2]: ^777777330%^000000 l ^7777772 ataques^000000\n[Nv 3]: ^777777440%^000000 l ^7777772 ataques^000000\n[Nv 4]: ^777777550%^000000 l ^7777772 ataques^000000\n[Nv 5]: ^777777660%^000000 l ^7777773 ataques^000000"}, "name": {"en": "Moonlight", "pt": "Pica-Pau"}},
